     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. The dose looks like a possible error, so I'd like you to confirm it first.\n\n**The problem:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to **6400 mg/day**.\n- The usual maximum single dose is **800 mg**. This order is twice that.\n- The usual maximum daily dose is **3200 mg/day**. This order is twice that.\n\nAt this dose the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and other NSAID toxicity is much higher, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**Possible intended orders:**\n1. **400 mg PO four times daily** (1600 mg/day total). The \"1600\" may have been the daily total.\n2. **800 mg PO three or four times daily** (2400\u20133200 mg/day), the maximum anti-inflammatory dose.\n3. **Something else.** Just tell me the dose and frequency.\n\nIf you did mean 1600 mg four times daily, tell me the clinical reason and I'll add it as a note on the order. Your hospital's pharmacy will probably also flag a dose this high for review."
      }
     ],
